mber of a declared terrorist organisation (see section 35AA); or  (b) acting on instruction of, or in cooperation with, a declared terrorist organisation.  (5) To avoid doubt, subsection (4) does not prevent the proof or establishment, by other means, that a person engaged in conduct with an intention referred to in subsection (3).  (6) Words and expressions used in paragraphs (2)(a) to (h) have the same meanings as in Subdivision A of Division 72, sections 101.1," ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer .

