    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-33aa-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) To avoid doubt, subsection (4) does not prevent the proof or establishment, by other means, that a person engaged in conduct with an intention referred to in subsection (3)." ;
