    values:originalText "(11) A notice under paragraph (10)(a) must set out:  (a) the matters required by section 35B; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166  Schedule 1  Main amendments  Australian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015 No. 166, 2015  (b) the person’s rights of review." ;
