doc:sch-1-sec-101-ss-16 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "101(16) 2, 102.2, 102.4, 103.1 and 103.2 and Division 119 of the" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(16) To avoid doubt, in deciding whether to consider exercising the power in subsection (14), the Minister is not required to have regard to any of the matters referred to in subsection (17)." ;
