concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-101-ss-19 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "101(19) 2, 102.2, 102.4, 103.1 and 103.2 and Division 119 of the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-101-ss-19 ;
    values:originalText "(19) If the Minister thinks that it would not be in the public interest to publish the name of the person or of any other person connected in any way with the matter concerned, the statement under subsection (18) must not include those names or any information that may identify those persons. General provisions relating to Minister’s powers" ;
    skos:definition "(19) If the Minister thinks that it would not be in the public interest to publish the name of the person or of any other person connected in any way with the matter concerned, the statement under subsection (18) must not include those names or any information that may identify those persons. General provisions relating to Minister’s powers"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c0b52a64e97f0794297233095293feb54352cc9be0ce702d909fe59ffb8be2d9" ;
