concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35-ss-10 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35(10) Service outside Australia in armed forces of an enemy country or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-35-ss-10 ;
    values:originalText "(10) The Minister does not have a duty to consider whether to exercise the power under subsection (9) in respect of any person, whether the Minister is requested to do so by the person who has ceased to be a citizen under this section, or by any other person, or in any other circumstances." ;
    skos:definition "(10) The Minister does not have a duty to consider whether to exercise the power under subsection (9) in respect of any person, whether the Minister is requested to do so by the person who has ceased to be a citizen under this section, or by any other person, or in any other circumstances."@en ;
