    skos:prefLabel "35AB(1) Sections 33AA and 35 do not apply to conduct of Australian"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-35ab-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Sections 33AA and 35 do not apply to conduct engaged in by:  (a) a person in the proper performance of a function of an Australian law enforcement or intelligence body; or  (b) a person acting in the course of the person’s duty to the Commonwealth in relation to the defence, security or international relations of Australia. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166  Schedule 1  Main amendments  Australian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015 No. 166, 2015" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Sections 33AA and 35 do not apply to conduct engaged in by:  (a) a person in the proper performance of a function of an Australian law enforcement or intelligence body; or  (b) a person acting in the course of the person’s duty to the Commonwealth in relation to the defence, security or international relations of Australia. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166  Schedule 1  Main amendments  Australian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015 No. 166, 2015"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f4e0d7d7dd18bdc9daff8e16af53143f5df072d3e63933a9e8d2bc6c680235f8" ;
