concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35ab-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35AB(2) Sections 33AA and 35 do not apply to conduct of Australian"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-35ab-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) In this section: Australian law enforcement or intelligence body means a body, agency or organisation of the Commonwealth, or of a State or Territory, that is responsible for, or deals with, law enforcement, criminal intelligence, criminal investigation, fraud, security intelligence, foreign intelligence or financial intelligence." ;
