concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35A(4) Conviction for terrorism offences and certain other offences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purpose of paragraph (1)(b):  (a) the reference to being sentenced to a period of imprisonment does not include a suspended sentence; and  (b) if a single sentence of imprisonment is imposed in respect of both an offence against a provision mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) and in respect of one or more other offences, then:  (i) if it is clear that only a particular part of the total period of imprisonment relates to the offence against the provision mentioned in paragraph (1)(a)—the person is taken to have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect of that offence for that part of the total period of imprisonment; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166  Schedule 1  Main amendments  Australian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015 No. 166, 2015  (ii) if subparagraph (i) does not apply—the person is taken to have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect of the offence against the provision mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) for the whole of the total period of imprisonment. Minister to give notice" ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purpose of paragraph (1)(b):  (a) the reference to being sentenced to a period of imprisonment does not include a suspended sentence; and  (b) if a single sentence of imprisonment is imposed in respect of both an offence against a provision mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) and in respect of one or more other offences, then:  (i) if it is clear that only a particular part of the total period of imprisonment relates to the offence against the provision mentioned in paragraph (1)(a)—the person is taken to have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect of that offence for that part of the total period of imprisonment; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166  Schedule 1  Main amendments  Australian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015 No. 166, 2015  (ii) if subparagraph (i) does not apply—the person is taken to have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect of the offence against the provision mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) for the whole of the total period of imprisonment. Minister to give notice"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8d3552cf1e051ee92e921eaa7409589faa6ab2cca41c6c13305203d0f8823f86" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A person is taken to have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect of the offence against the provision mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) for that part of the total period of imprisonment if it is clear that only a particular part of the total period relates to the offence." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.18" ;
    cml:asserts concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4-norm .
