concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4 cml:asserts concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4-logic-deontic-3 .
