concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35A(2) Conviction for terrorism offences and certain other offences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-35a-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A notice that is given to a person under paragraph 35A(5)(a) must:  (a) state that the Minister has determined under section 35A that the person has ceased to be an Australian citizen; and  (b) include the reasons for the decision to make the determination." ;
    skos:definition "(2) A notice that is given to a person under paragraph 35A(5)(a) must:  (a) state that the Minister has determined under section 35A that the person has ceased to be an Australian citizen; and  (b) include the reasons for the decision to make the determination."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "80d0eee66232eda436b8f897d1b3a882beae545970a4cd97dd111faf3c3a6cf6" ;
