concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-36a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36A No resumption of citizenship if citizenship ceases under"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-36a ;
    values:originalText "section 33AA, 35 or 35A  If under section 33AA, 35 or 35A a person ceases to be an Australian citizen, then Divisions 1 and 2 of this Part do not apply in relation to the person on and after the time of that cessation. Note: The effect of this section is that (subject to subsections 33AA(14) and (24), 35(9) and (19) and 35A(8) and (9)) the person can never become an Australian citizen again." ;
    skos:definition "section 33AA, 35 or 35A  If under section 33AA, 35 or 35A a person ceases to be an Australian citizen, then Divisions 1 and 2 of this Part do not apply in relation to the person on and after the time of that cessation. Note: The effect of this section is that (subject to subsections 33AA(14) and (24), 35(9) and (19) and 35A(8) and (9)) the person can never become an Australian citizen again."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5d11705df2d0a2c809032fd0f7fa3a6d417367bb8648bd16945d823fb91bb8fd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No resumption of citizenship if citizenship ceases under section 33AA, 35 or 35A." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf> ;
