concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-2-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Application of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments of the Independent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010 and the Intelligence Services Act 2001 made by this Schedule apply in relation to sections 33AA, 35 and 35A of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 as in force on and after the commencement of this Act.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 24 June 2015 Senate on 30 November 2015]  (125/15) ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166" ;
    skos:definition "The amendments of the Independent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010 and the Intelligence Services Act 2001 made by this Schedule apply in relation to sections 33AA, 35 and 35A of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 as in force on and after the commencement of this Act.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 24 June 2015 Senate on 30 November 2015]  (125/15) ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "09062ae7397882804ac1ce4e654a45da20783713b512a9a090b5c57d211439df" ;
    cof:pageNumber "27"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application of amendments" ;
